OL,3,GNEWSACricketer 'giving back' after
OL,4,Ason's cleft surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricketer has said he wants to "give
OL,7,Fback" to those who helped repair his
OL,8,Fnewborn son's cleft lip and palate.
OL,10,FTom Kohler-Cadmore, who plays for
OL,11,FSomerset, will swap his bat for golf
OL,12,Fclubs to raise money for Cleft Lip and
OL,13,FPalate Action (CLAPA), and to build a
OL,14,F#2 million centre at Bristol Dental
OL,15,FHospital to provide care for patients
OL,16,Fwith the condition.
OL,18,FHis son, Dougie, has had two operations
OL,19,Fto correct his cleft lip, which is a
OL,20,Fgap or split in the upper lip and/or
OL,21,Froof of the mouth (palate) that is
OL,22,Fpresent from birth.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
